{"UUID":"c3fa11ea-d56f-4b04-a967-d90b65762f93","DebugName":"InterSec_Patrol_Nyx_Super","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_Career","MissionType":{"UUID":"62f92440-202a-43d3-9cb8-b917d4e4a102","Name":"Mercenary"},"MissionGiver":"InterSec Defense Solutions","Title":"Patrol Vanduul Hunting Ground","TitleKey":"InterSec_SecurityPatrol_S_Title_001","Description":"MISSION SPECS\n\nArea of Operation: Nyx System\nHostile Forces: Vanduul\nEquipment Specs: Combat-rated Ships\nBriefing: There's a growing concern that Vanduul hunting parties are pushing further into Nyx. The first line of defense against this encroachment is increased patrols. InterSec has identified a sector that has seen an uptick in Vanduul activity and are looking for someone to patrol the region and provide an update on it.\n\nYou'll begin your patrol at a <EM4>location marker</EM4> sent to your HUD and then scan a series of waypoints along a designated route. The Vanduul ships in this sector are highly skilled and aggressive, so InterSec highly recommends that you <EM4>bring several combat-ready ships along as backup</EM4>.\n\nInterSec understands the immense danger you'll be under on this patrol, so we'll send a special bonus of <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) MG Scrip</EM4> to the main contractor once the sector is clear.      \n\nRespectfully,\n\nDeacon Tobin\nOperations Manager\nInterSec Defense Solutions\n\nThis communication consists of a non-binding offer that upon acceptance may be immediately terminated by either party without any given notice. All operations are conducted at the contractor\u2019s own personal risk and must adhere to system law where applicable.","DescriptionKey":"InterSec_SecurityPatrol_S_Desc_001","DisplayDescription":"MISSION SPECS\n\nArea of Operation: Nyx System\nHostile Forces: Vanduul\nEquipment Specs: Combat-rated Ships\nBriefing: There's a growing concern that Vanduul hunting parties are pushing further into Nyx. The first line of defense against this encroachment is increased patrols. InterSec has identified a sector that has seen an uptick in Vanduul activity and are looking for someone to patrol the region and provide an update on it.\n\nYou'll begin your patrol at a <EM4>location marker</EM4> sent to your HUD and then scan a series of waypoints along a designated route. The Vanduul ships in this sector are highly skilled and aggressive, so InterSec highly recommends that you <EM4>bring several combat-ready ships along as backup</EM4>.\n\nInterSec understands the immense danger you'll be under on this patrol, so we'll send a special bonus of <EM4>[ScripAmount] MG Scrip</EM4> to the main contractor once the sector is clear.      \n\nRespectfully,\n\nDeacon Tobin\nOperations Manager\nInterSec Defense Solutions\n\nThis communication consists of a non-binding offer that upon acceptance may be immediately terminated by either party without any given notice. All operations are conducted at the contractor\u2019s own personal risk and must adhere to system law where applicable.","LocationPools":{"InvisibleTimerMissionLocationBP":{"ResolvedLocations":[{"UUID":"a8f96e99-2482-4673-9395-d44d8525ee9a","LocationTemplateUUID":"a8f96e99-2482-4673-9395-d44d8525ee9a","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"27683e1d-5b07-4338-9168-d2c1b91293a2","LocationTemplateUUID":"27683e1d-5b07-4338-9168-d2c1b91293a2","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"907d4b3b-f4f6-4f29-9229-e2f8caf95729","LocationTemplateUUID":"907d4b3b-f4f6-4f29-9229-e2f8caf95729","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"392ba55f-77f4-4241-84e9-97d07bda6554","LocationTemplateUUID":"392ba55f-77f4-4241-84e9-97d07bda6554","Name":"Keeger Belt Wreck Site"},{"UUID":"a8bf3c91-7a06-4950-8216-9cd5b80c7a78","LocationTemplateUUID":"a8bf3c91-7a06-4950-8216-9cd5b80c7a78","Name":"Keeger Belt Wreck Site"},{"UUID":"4c2485e4-38ff-47d6-9405-ccc3cd91da82","LocationTemplateUUID":"4c2485e4-38ff-47d6-9405-ccc3cd91da82","Name":"Glaciem Ring"},{"UUID":"8e8cd2d9-82c5-461e-b35c-4454bea4ec19","LocationTemplateUUID":"8e8cd2d9-82c5-461e-b35c-4454b